+
+## iPadOS 27 AMFI stack granule
+
+The `ipados-27.0.1-24A446` OS patch series selects `patches/xnu-12377/native-amfi-stack-granule.patch`. It retains the live stack size and three guard pages, aligns allocations to the next power of two containing the live stack and guards, and exports `unixnu_kernel_stack_shift` for the reviewed AMFI DER stack-budget consumer. This is not a replacement for the VM page shift. Host geometry checks cover guard-before-alignment behavior; hardware AMFI execution remains unverified.
+
+## iPadOS 27 IOKit service-start permission check
+
+The selected OS series includes `patches/xnu-12377/native-iokit-start-check.patch`. The 24A446 service-start code invokes a two-argument MAC policy callback at offset `0x1e8`, with discriminator `0xe4fe`; this corresponds to `reserved22` in the selected public source. The patch gives that slot a local typed name, dispatches through the existing MAC framework, and makes `IOService::start` return false on denial. The local hook name is reconstructed from binary ABI evidence. Policy-table size and all other offsets stay unchanged. Host denial/argument tests and compiled call/slot/PAC checks are required; boot compatibility is separate.
